SUMMARY:"Inside the Faery Realm" Ballet
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Labor Day weekend with a whimsical outdoor ballet designed especially for kids and families! Join us for an enchanting performance by Mosaic Dance Theater Company featuring fairy-themed dance\, storytelling\, and the natural beauty of the gardens. After the performance\, children can visit our Fairy Garden and build their own fairy home for our magical little visitors. Feel free to come dressed as a magical character!\nTickets are $5 per person/$20 per family. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
