SUMMARY:Raise a Glass with the Admiral of the Blue Apron: Montclair History Center's Annual Meeting
DESCRIPTION:The Montclair History Center is pleased to welcome The Admiral of the Blue Apron Michael Carver\, a noted Historical Interpreter and Reenactor\, as the featured guest of our Annual Meeting. The Admiral will offer attendees a glimpse into 18th-century tavern culture\, discuss drinks and traditions that shaped colonial social life. Guests will have the opportunity to sample authentic period punch and colonial beer. \nFollowing the tasting experience\, our Board of Trustees and Executive Director Angelica Diggs will share highlights and reflect on the past year’s accomplishments and look ahead to what’s next. \nWe invite you to join us for an evening that blends a taste of living history with a look at what lies ahead for the Montclair History Center. \nRSVP online here: https://events.humanitix.com/raise-a-glass-with-the-admiral-of-the-blue-apron-montclair-history-center-s-annual-meeting/tickets \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
