SUMMARY:Finding Paddy
DESCRIPTION:Montclair filmmaker Steve McCarthy looks at the life of his friend FDNY Captain Patrick “Paddy” Brown\, after he dies in the World Trade Center on 9/11. He finds a complicated story of a man traumatized by alcohol\, the Vietnam War and the fires of New York. Sometimes a hero can come from some of the most awful places imaginable. \nQ&A with director Steve McCarthy and producers Nancy Erika Smith and Neil Marc Mullin follows the screening. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
