SUMMARY:Yoga Teacher Training Informational
DESCRIPTION:Want to learn about the next Yoga Teacher Training at Yoga Mechanics? \nJoin us online for a short info session on 9/7 at 7:00pm \nAttend an informational and get 2 weeks of unlimited yoga to try out the studio! \nOur 200 HR YTT is a powerful and effective process of self-growth. This streamlined training is just enough\, it fits into your schedule without being overwhelming. We have crafted a program that is modular\, cumulative and taps into the collective power of our community. \nProgram Length – September 2026 – April 2027; all sessions will be recorded \nWe meet Tuesday Nights Virtually for two hours and one Weekend a Month In Person \nMore Info on YM Teacher Training:\nhttps://www.yogamechanics.com/teachertrainings \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
