SUMMARY:2Pac Revisited: A Concert Fundraiser for Family Healing Center
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to 2Pac Revisited!!! In a world where celebrity & fame can distract us from real issues in our society\, there are those who transcend beyond recognition. Many of those challenges deal with mental health\, especially in the black & brown communities. Tupac Shakur\, a revolution artist\, challenged society & its people in such a way; his work continues to be reexamined\, celebrated\, & taught even at a higher learning level. This event is dedicated the Tupac Shakur’s not to glorify his fame\, but to his humanity\, as a community leader\, entrepreneur\, & his love for people. This event will be raising both awareness & fundraising for a mental health-based organization called Family Health Care. There mission states: Our mission is to empower people\, build strong families and transform communities through a team of caring professionals who are rooted in faith\, hope\, and love. \n2Pac Revisited will be presented in 3 Parts. \nPanel Discussion: Starting at 3PM\, there will be a panel discussion taking place at Montclair Public Library about Tupac’s humanity. It will include renowned conversations moderated by NJ artist ROSTAFA. There will also be a Q&A discussion after the fact. ***THIS EVENT IS FREE TO ATTEND*** \nConcert Fundraiser: If weather permits\, this will be taking place at Montclair Brewery (101 Walnut Street). Doors will be open at 5:30PM. A special poetry section will begin at 6PM featuring local poets. At approximately 7PM\, a 2 set concert of entirely Tupac’s discography will be performed by local rappers\, singers\, dancers\, & musicians. This event is for mature audiences only (21 & up). You must purchase a ticket for the concert event!!! No outside alcohol is permitted under any circumstances!!! There is also a 2 minimum drink requirement. ***IF WEATHER DOESN’T PERMIT\, THERE WILL BE AN ALTERNATIVE LOCATION WHERE THE CONCERT WILL TAKE PLACE & ANNOUNCED IN ADVANCE!!!*** \nAfter Party: In celebration of all the hard work that has gone into this day\, please help us celebrate with an after-party at a TBA location at 10:30PM. ***THIS EVENT IS OPEN TO THE PUBLIC*** \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/2pac-revisited-a-concert-fundraiser-for-family-healing-center/
LOCATION:Montclair Brewery\, 101 Walnut Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art & Culture,Entertainment,Food,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2pac-flier.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="ROSTAFA":MAILTO:lastwaltzshow@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
