SUMMARY:Welcome Fest Sundays at UUCM
DESCRIPTION:Primary Welcome Fest Sundays:\nSeptember13th\, 11am-12:30pm: Welcome Fest – Connect\nLearn about and connect with Covenant Groups\, Support Groups\, Small Groups\, Children’s Religious Education and Adult Religious Education at UUCM. \nSeptember 20th\, 11am-12:30pm: Welcome Fest – Engage\nLearn about and engage with Justice Efforts\, Teams\, Committees\, and your Governance bodies at UUCM. \nSeptember 27th\, 11am-12:30pm: Welcome Fest – Family Day\nHave a joyful afternoon sharing community with all ages and participating in fun and fellowship. \nOther Welcome Fest Events:\nSeptember 18th – Fletcher’s Listening Room Presents Claire Wellin\, Brooklyn based singer\, songwriter\, and violinist whose music maps a lineage of women whose stories feel as urgent as they are inherited. Wellin\, a Grammy Nominated artist produces music with a tactile quality that is active\, and filled with defiance\, strength and self definition. Listen to the single\, “Woman of the Future\,” to get a sense of her skill and power. Register: tinyurl.com/UUCMFLRCW.\nSunday September 27th – Dismantling Antisemitism\, a training and community centered experience with renowned facilitator Megan Black Johnson. This offering is specifically for our congregation\, Unity Congregational Church and B’Nai Keshet Synagogue. It will offer us a way to build bridges of understanding while confronting the rising anti-semetic attitudes and practices that are harming our neighbors and our collective capacity for justice work. Register: tinyurl.com/UUCMBKDA. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/welcome-fest-sundays-at-uucm/2026-09-13/
LOCATION:UU Congregation at Montclair\, 67 Church Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community,Kids & Families
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Welcome-Fest-Sundays-2026.png
ORGANIZER;CN="UU Congregation at Montclair":MAILTO:OFFICEMGR@UUMONTCLAIR.ORG
END:VEVENT
