SUMMARY:Understanding Medicare
DESCRIPTION:Confused about Medicare? Join us for an informative session that breaks down the basics of this federal health insurance program. Learn who qualifies\, including adults age 65 and older\, younger individuals with disabilities\, and those with End-Stage Renal Disease (ESRD). \nWe’ll explain the different parts of Medicare—Part A (hospital insurance)\, Part B (medical insurance)\, and Part D (prescription drug coverage)—and what services each covers. The program will also explore your coverage options\, including Original Medicare with supplemental (Medigap) plans and Medicare Advantage (Part C). \nThis session is ideal for anyone approaching Medicare eligibility\, caregivers\, or those looking to better understand their health coverage choices. \nPresented by Medicare Specialist Jacki Spear. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
