SUMMARY:NJSave Information Session
DESCRIPTION:On September 16 from 11:30am – 12:30am\, the Office of Assemblywoman Bagolie and Lifelong Montclair will be holding an NJSave Information Session at the Wally Choice Community Center\, located at 45 Maple ave in Montclair. \nAt the event\, they will be hosting a speaker from the Division of Aging Services to explain how to apply for the NJSave program and the benefits that it can provide. The speaker will also discuss other work done by the Division of Aging Services and county offices focused on senior services across the state. \nA flyer has been attached for further information about this event. If you are interested in attending\, please fill out the following form to register: https://schedulesplus.com/montclair/kiosk/dspevent.do?event_id=482948&detail_id=6602082&filterschedule_id=&dt=2026-09-01 \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
