SUMMARY:Women and Money Roundtable - How to Make Sense of Today's Financial Markets
DESCRIPTION:A virtual\, lively\, and informative discussion on today’s financial markets and how they might fit into your portfolio. \nJulia Strayer and Liz Maccarone will lead a lively and informative discussion on today’s financial markets and how they might fit into your portfolio. \nThis is a virtual program that takes place over Zoom. As the date approaches\, you will receive an email with the Zoom link. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
